<p>
  Choose the product chooser to use when entering bugs.
</p>

<p>
  <label for="product_chooser">Product chooser:</label>
  <select id="product_chooser" name="product_chooser">
    <option value="pretty"[% ' selected="selected"' IF product_chooser == 'pretty' %]>
      Pretty chooser
    </option>
    <option value="full"[% ' selected="selected"' IF product_chooser == 'full' %]>
      Full chooser
    </option>
    <option value="small"[% ' selected="selected"' IF product_chooser == 'small' %]>
      Small chooser
    </option>
  </select>
</p>

[%# You could put an example screenshot of each chooser type here for
    the user to see what their choice does, for example. %]
